  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"buttons\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count\">+</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML page with counter display and three labeled buttons."
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1e1e2e;\n  --card: #2a2a3c;\n  --text: #e0e0ff;\n  --accent: #7aa2f7;\n  --accent-dark: #3b5bdb;\n  --pixel: 4px;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border: var(--pixel) solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--accent-dark);\n  text-align: center;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  padding: 16px;\n  border: var(--pixel) solid var(--accent-dark);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--bg);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: none;\n  border-bottom: var(--pixel) solid var(--accent-dark);\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n  min-width: 64px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover { background: #9bb8ff; }\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  border-bottom-width: 2px;\n}\n\n#reset {\n  background: var(--text);\n  border-bottom-color: #8888aa;\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\n#reset:hover { background: #ffffff; }\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 24px 16px; }\n  #count { font-size: 3rem; }\n  button { padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 1rem; min-width: 56px; }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-art styled CSS with palette, hover/focus/active states, responsive layout."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "let count = 0;\nconst countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});",
      "description": "JavaScript logic for increment, decrement, reset with no storage or dependencies."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA self-contained offline pixel-art style counter.\n\n## Features\n- Starts at 0\n- Increase (+1) and decrease (−1) buttons\n- Reset to zero\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard accessible with visible focus states\n- Responsive from 360px width\n\n## Usage\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server, dependencies, or storage required.\n\n## Controls\n- **+** button: adds 1 to the count\n- **−** button: subtracts 1 from the count\n- **Reset** button: sets the count back to 0\n\nAll buttons are focusable and labeled for screen readers.\n\n## Files\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `style.css` – pixel-art styling\n- `script.js` – counter logic",
      "description": "README with usage instructions and feature list."
    }
  ]
}